{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Demo, guide Naginami as they ascend the enigmatic Yora in search of their beloved, Iza. In this 2.5D adventure, utilize the Crimson Thread, to swing, grapple, and pull your way through 2 unique peaks and platforming challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999530/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.poster.avif?t=1757294928\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999530/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.webm?t=1757294928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999530/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.mp4?t=1757294928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a myriad of distinctive creatures, each offering a unique approach to the base thread mechanics providing depth in your traversal options.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse two out of 7 breathtaking peaks rich with symbolism and mystery, where every step forward brings you closer to understanding the profound connections that bind us all. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth tales of the lost Ambi as you encounter Goddess Statues at the top of each peak.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999530?t=1757294928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999530/cbe402e1a5a9a4be150a744765bf92a90be99cdd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757294928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999530/53f4338aded7446e3c0246311bd564c4f3b9c846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757294928","cap